---
import PageLayout from '../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
import CTASection from '../components/CTASection.astro';
---

<PageLayout
  title="Free Finance Automation Resources | Forge RPA"
  description="Free, ungated tools and guides for finance, accounting, and operations automation. An interactive ROI calculator and a plain guide to the five processes worth automating first. No email required."
  heroTitle="Resources for Finance and Operations Leaders"
  heroSubtitle="Practical tools and insights drawn from real finance operations experience, applied with the same discipline to operations and administrative automation when the work is rules-based and the systems are accessible."
>
  <section class="py-20 lg:py-28">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="text-center mb-16">
        <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-charcoal mb-6">Free Tools &amp; Guides</h2>
        <p class="text-xl text-gray-600 max-w-2xl mx-auto">
          Two resources built from 30 years of financial operations experience, open on the web with no sign-up and no
          email wall. Use them to size an opportunity and decide what is worth automating first.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-4 text-sm text-gray-500 max-w-2xl mx-auto">
          Want to talk through your numbers or your roadmap?{' '}
          <a href="/contact" class="text-amber-dark hover:text-amber font-semibold">Book a 30-minute discovery call</a>.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8">
        <!-- Month-End Close Checklist retired 2026-07-02 (David's call: accounting
             teams already own their close SOPs; the asset added no pull). The file
             stays in /downloads for old links; only the card is removed. -->

        <!-- ROI Calculator: now an ungated interactive web tool at /tools/roi-calculator.
             (Retired: the raw .xlsx behind an email gate. The file stays in
             /downloads so old links still resolve; only the card changed.) -->
        <div class="flex flex-col bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-2xl p-8 hover:border-amber transition-colors">
          <div class="text-amber text-4xl mb-6">📈</div>
          <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-charcoal mb-3">Finance Automation ROI Calculator</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-600 mb-6 flex-1">
            Enter hours removed per month, loaded hourly cost, adoption, implementation spend, and annual run-state.
            See monthly and annual labor savings, year-one net, and simple payback update live as you type. Nothing to
            download, nothing to sign up for.
          </p>
          <a
            href="/tools/roi-calculator"
            class="inline-flex w-full items-center justify-center px-6 py-3 bg-amber hover:bg-amber-dark text-charcoal font-semibold rounded-lg transition-colors sm:w-auto"
          >
            Open the Calculator
          </a>
        </div>

        <!-- Five processes: now an ungated web page at /resources/finance-processes-to-automate.
             (Retired: the PDF behind an email gate. The PDF stays in /downloads
             so old links still resolve; only the card changed.) -->
        <div class="flex flex-col bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-2xl p-8 hover:border-amber transition-colors">
          <div class="text-amber text-4xl mb-6">🎯</div>
          <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-charcoal mb-3">Five Finance Processes to Automate First</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-600 mb-6 flex-1">
            A plain guide to five process families that routinely produce strong returns when the data and the ownership
            line up: AP match, reconciliations, month-end packs, intercompany support, and operational reporting. Each
            one links to how we build for it, with honest caveats.
          </p>
          <a
            href="/resources/finance-processes-to-automate"
            class="inline-flex w-full items-center justify-center px-6 py-3 bg-amber hover:bg-amber-dark text-charcoal font-semibold rounded-lg transition-colors sm:w-auto"
          >
            Read the Guide
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-12 text-center">
        <p class="text-gray-600 mb-4">
          Both resources are open on the web, free, with nothing gated. If they are useful, the best next step is a
          short conversation about your specific process.
        </p>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-500">
          These tools were developed from real finance operations experience and refined through our proprietary
          framework. Proven in finance, and applicable to other operational processes.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <CTASection
    heading="Ready to Reduce Manual Finance Work?"
    subtext="Book a 30-minute discovery call. We will review your specific challenges and show you how our framework can deliver results."
    ctaText="Start the Conversation"
    ctaLink="/contact"
  />
</PageLayout>
